    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85075" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυ-μήχᾰνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>resourceful,
			inventive,</i> epith. of Odysseus, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.173
			</span></i>, etc., cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1135
			</span></i> (lyr.); of Apollo, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Merc.</u>
				319
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. μήτηρ,</span> of Nature, <i><span class="en">
